_top_angle_deg ,return_mode='flat')" ref="/data/spatial_geometry"><label>Spatial geometry</label><input ref="/data/spatial_geometry/input_horizontal_distance_m"><label>Horizontal distance to object (m)</label></input><input ref="/data/spatial_geometry/input_observer_height_m"><label>Observer eye height (m)</label></input><input ref="/data/spatial_geometry/input_base_angle_deg"><label>Angle to base (degrees)</label></input><input ref="/data/spatial_geometry/input_top_angle_deg"><label>Angle to top (degrees)</label></input><select1 ref="/data/spatial_geometry/measurement_method_choice"><label>Measurement</label><item><label>Tree height</label><value>tree_height</value></item><item><label>Slope / inclination</label><value>slope</value></item><item><label>Distance from angular size</label><value>distance</value></item></select1><input ref="/data/spatial_geometry/object_height_m"><label>Calculated object height (m)</label></input><input ref="/data/spatial_geometry/angle_difference_deg"><label>Angle difference (degrees)</label></input><input ref="/data/spatial_geometry/sensor_source"><label>Sensor source</label></input></group><input ref="/data/instructions"><label>For slope and distance estimation, change method_id and inputs in the intent as described in the capability documentation.</label></input></h:body></h:html>